   <narrative xml:lang="SV">LFA.kurser FRJ</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida har best&#xe4;mt att de lokala samarbetsorganisationerna m&#xe5;ste f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra sina kunskaper i LFA f&#xf6;r att kvalitetss&#xe4;kra  projektprocessen. F&#xf6;r att g&#xf6;ra detta anlitas Kari &#xd6;rtengren, tidigare p&#xe5; Sida f&#xf6;r att genomf&#xf6;ra LFA-kurser f&#xf6;r alla lokala partners.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida has decided that the local implementing partners must improve their knowledge of the LFA process in order to assure a continued high quality of the project process. Therefore, Sida has decided to engage Ms. Kari &#xd6;rtengren, previously with Sida, to conduct LFA seminars for the local partners.</narrative>
  </description>
